00:41:13.340 --> 00:41:15.610
[S14] Hero of Thousand Faces is the book, Joseph Campbell.

628
00:41:15.610 --> 00:41:19.730
[S14] What he did is he went through history and myths and so on.

629
00:41:19.730 --> 00:41:25.570
[S14] He says there's a certain type of person who has a taste for adventure and goes through

